# Documentation source of truth

**Routing table:** [`docs/README.md`](docs/README.md) and [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

## Tier 1 (read first)

- `docs/CURRENT_RUNTIME.md` — Stellar↔Jira sync
- `docs/MAINTENANCE.md` — ops
- `config/stellar_tenants.json` — tenant ops
- `.env` / `env.example` — runtime config

## Tier 2 (task-specific only)

- `docs/DEMO_MVP_v0.1.md` — xMDR Web / platform / demo API
- `docs/CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL.md` — tunnel / public URL
- `docs/DECISION_LAYER.md` — Decision Layer

## Do not read by default (Tier 3)

- `docs/PRD_v0.1.md` — future spec, mostly unimplemented
- `docs/ACTUAL_ARCHITECTURE_FOR_SPEC.md` — ChatGPT handoff duplicate
- `docs/Security_Decision_Platform_MVP_Spec_v1.0.md` — long spec; prefer CURRENT_RUNTIME
- `README.md` — human onboarding
- **`docs/archive/**`** — OUTDATED

Skip any file whose header says `DO NOT READ`, `OUTDATED`, or `DO NOT USE FOR RUNTIME`.

**Conflict order:** `.env` + `CURRENT_RUNTIME.md` + code ≫ `MAINTENANCE.md` ≫ others.
